 <section className="sample-section" id="test-labels"><span className="eyebrow">TRY THE EXPERIENCE</span><h2>A transparent sample set</h2><p>These fictional labels test supported records, combinations and uncertainty. They are not real medicines. Outcomes below are expected test cases, not claims about the model’s accuracy.</p><div className="sample-grid">{fixtures.map(f=><article key={f.id}><img src={`/test-labels/${f.file}`} alt={`Fictional test label: ${f.title}`} loading="lazy"/><span className="eyebrow">{f.kind}</span><h3>{f.title}</h3><p>Expected: {f.expectedId?`confirm ${f.expectedId}`:f.expectedStatus.replaceAll('_',' ')}</p><div className="button-row"><button className="secondary" onClick={()=>onSample(f.file)}>Try this label <ArrowRight size={14}/></button><a className="download-sample" href={`/test-labels/${f.file}`} download aria-label={`Download ${f.title} test label`}><Download size={17}/></a></div></article>)}</div></section>
