| Guided scan | Show framing/light/privacy advice and require a readable complete-photo checklist. | Checklist and consent gates checked. Guidance does not certify photo quality. |
| Recognition and recovery | Match complete ingredients, request better evidence, reject wrong suggestions. | Three published labels eventually matched, with one timeout retained; real moisturiser rejected. Real medicine phone photography pending. |
| Catalogue | Sixteen sourced generic records and conservative aliases. | Source dates, due dates and pending pharmacist status. Actual professional review pending. |
| Safety and explanations | Fixed guidance with approved source passages and pharmacist questions. | Unit checks and manual fallback work; no diagnosis, doses or personal suitability. |
| Review packet | Export exact source content for professional review. | Fingerprint, stale-build rejection and incomplete-review rejection checked. Downloading is not sign-off. |
| Pilot tools | Record outcomes and understanding with optional consented export. | Browser tests used fabricated data only. No participants or automatic collection. |
| Learning and samples | Teach resistance and practise with fictional labels. | Existing quiz/gallery preserved. Educational effectiveness unmeasured. |
| Demo insights | Illustrate a reporting view. | Synthetic numbers, unrelated to real observations. |
| Durable abuse controls | Shared per-client, global, daily and monthly reservation limits. | Real temporary Redis verification passed. Permanent production service not connected; public AI uses per-instance fallback budgets. |
| Operational monitoring | Log fixed success/fallback codes without images, prompts or participant records. | Application code emits structured events. Hosting/provider policies apply; staffed alerts not configured. |
| Pilot release gates | Require deliberate opening, date, reviewed content and shared controls. | Optional controlled-pilot policy; public educational AI is enabled independently of pending review. |

No feature is foolproof or clinically validated. See VERIFICATION.md and docs/LAUNCH.md for evidence and pending work.
</file>

